    "title": "JSON schema for JSON Document Transforms",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "description": "Please rename the field\u202f`oldField1` (located at\u202f`$.oldField1`) to **newField1**, and also rename the nested field\u202f`oldField2.sub` (at\u202f`$.oldField2.sub`) to **newField2**. Additionally, update the user\u2019s age by replacing the value at\u202f`$.user.age` with **42**.  \n\nFor cleanup, delete the entries at\u202f`$.temporary` and\u202f`$.metadata.debug`. Finally, merge the settings object found at\u202f`$.settings` with the following configuration: `{\"theme\":\"dark\",\"notifications\":false}`.",
  "reference_json": {
    "@jdt.rename": [
      {
        "@jdt.path": "$.oldField1",
        "@jdt.value": "newField1"
      },
      {
        "@jdt.path": "$.oldField2.sub",
        "@jdt.value": "newField2"
      }
    ],
    "@jdt.replace": {
      "@jdt.path": "$.user.age",
      "@jdt.value": "42"
    },
    "@jdt.remove": [
      "$.temporary",
      "$.metadata.debug"
    ],
    "@jdt.merge": {
      "@jdt.path": "$.settings",
      "@jdt.value": "{\"theme\":\"dark\",\"notifications\":false}"
    }
  }
}